    _w31_expect U41-01 `"(`"`bad'"' == "")"' `"missing: `bad'"'
    _w31_done U41-01 "colour_width_edges_truth.json is stamped and holds every probe"

    // U41-09: a scheme's %40 on color histogram draws at 0.4 in both
